:\n- Queen on g1 attacks king on e1\n- King cannot move to d1 (controlled by queen on g1)\n- King cannot move to d2 (queen controls it)\n- King cannot move to e2 (blocked or controlled)\n- King cannot move to f1 (controlled by queen)\n- King cannot move to f2 (my knight is there!)\n- No piece can capture the queen on g1\n- No piece can block\n\nReason:\nQ: h2-g1 delivers immediate checkmate. The queen controls all escape squares around the White king, and with my knight on f2 also restricting king movement, White has no defense.\n\nAnswer: Q: h2-g1"}
