resting but a queen is far more powerful.\n\nReason: The move P: c2-d1-q is clearly the strongest. It promotes my pawn to a queen while simultaneously capturing White's queen on d1 (if present) or at minimum giving check to the White king. This is a forcing move that dramatically shifts the material balance in my favor. Promoting with capture/check is tactically winning and should lead to a decisive advantage.\n\nAnswer: P: c2-d1-q"}
