 piece deep in my position. Removing this knight:\n- Eliminates a dangerous advanced piece\n- Wins material (a knight is worth about 3 pawns)\n- Simplifies the position in my favor\n- Opens the d-file for potential rook activity\n\nThis is a straightforward tactical win - capturing an undefended piece.\n\n**Answer:** P: d7-c6"}
